==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Skuntank|115}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*'''Smokescreen Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Octillery|34}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

